/// M30 HISTORY-046 "T26 comparison: run shape".
/// Source: tests/baseline/
/// t26_product_guide_test.go symbol
/// TestT26AgentComparisonReportConsistent
/// (L150-207): registry leg (L154-155); report leg
/// (L159-160); trials leg (L162-163); significance
/// leg (L165-166); per-case legs (L169-180); omit
/// leg (L181-185); count leg (L186-187); deferral
/// leg (L189-190); slot legs (L193-203); prose leg
/// (L204-205).
/// Disposition: consolidate (this row ports
/// TestT26AgentComparisonReportConsistent to
/// ordinary Can functions; the old Go harness stays
/// until the integrator retires it after every
/// linked row, variant, environment and control has
/// accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the live run shape: the
/// test name, the thirteen refusal wordings in Go
/// order, the Fatal plus Error calls, and the
/// fatal/error/diagnostic counts.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines):
/// test-name pins TestT26AgentComparisonReportConsistent
/// (L150); fatal-registry-task pins the registry
/// inner bytes (L155); fatal-report-task pins the
/// report inner bytes (L160); fatal-report-trials
/// pins the trials inner bytes (L163);
/// fatal-significance pins the significance inner
/// bytes (L166); error-case-trials pins the case
/// trials inner bytes (L172); error-case-tokens pins
/// the case tokens inner bytes (L175);
/// error-case-disposition pins the no-disposition
/// inner bytes (L178); error-omit-case pins the omit
/// inner bytes (L183); error-case-count pins the
/// count inner bytes (L187); error-no-deferred pins
/// the no-deferral inner bytes (L190);
/// error-slot-missing pins the missing inner bytes
/// (L197); error-slot-deferral pins the deferral
/// inner bytes (L201); error-prose-missing pins the
/// prose inner bytes (L205); fatal-call pins
/// t.Fatalf (L155); error-call pins t.Error (L172);
/// fatal-count pins int (4) from the four legs
/// (L155/L160/L163/L166); error-count pins int (9)
/// from the nine legs
/// (L172/L175/L178/L183/L187/L190/L197/L201/L205);
/// diagnostic-count pins int (13) as four plus nine.
/// Facet map (launch plus diagnostics): test-name
/// pins the test (L150); fatal-registry-task pins
/// registry plus quoted got (L155); fatal-report-task
/// pins report plus quoted got (L160);
/// fatal-report-trials pins trials plus got (L163);
/// fatal-significance pins significance plus quoted
/// got (L166); error-case-trials pins case plus
/// quoted got (L172); error-case-tokens pins case
/// plus count (L175); error-case-disposition pins
/// case (L178); error-omit-case pins the id (L183);
/// error-case-count pins both lens (L187);
/// error-no-deferred pins no deferral (L190);
/// error-slot-missing pins slot plus err (L197);
/// error-slot-deferral pins slot (L201);
/// error-prose-missing pins err (L205); fatal-call
/// pins t.Fatalf (L155); error-call pins t.Error
/// (L172); fatal-count pins 4; error-count pins 9;
/// diagnostic-count pins 13.
/// The base facts live in
/// history-046-base-semantics.can; the roots-green pin
/// lives in history-046-roots-green.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; default
/// plus seeded drifts only).
/// Environment: none (no gates; requires []).
/// Logical gates WORK/BUILD/CHILD/CLOCK bind at P23;
/// no live run now. Accept gate P23 is unmet. Timeout
/// 120000ms is the offline default bound (no Go
/// timeout in this row; binds at P23 like the M11
/// no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23
/// unmet).
/// Case history/t26-report-run checks: test-name,
/// fatal-registry-task, fatal-report-task,
/// fatal-report-trials, fatal-significance,
/// error-case-trials, error-case-tokens,
